+##### significantDigits
+
+Type: `number`\
+Default: `3`
+
+Round to this many significant digits instead of the default 3.
+
+Only applies when neither `minimumFractionDigits` nor `maximumFractionDigits` is set. Invalid values (anything but an integer from 1 to 100) are ignored and the default is used.
+
+```js
+import prettyBytes from 'pretty-bytes';
+
+prettyBytes(1337, {significantDigits: 2});
+//=> '1.3 kB'
+
+prettyBytes(1337, {significantDigits: 4});
+//=> '1.337 kB'
+
+prettyBytes(1337);
+//=> '1.34 kB'
+```
+
 ##### space
 
